Amendment 01: The purpose of this amendment is to correct the due date on the SAM.gov synopsis to align with the RFQ attachment.&nbsp; 

The Naval Undersea Warfare Center Division Newport (NUWCDIVNPT) intends to award a Firm Fixed Price Type purchase order for&nbsp;Rotary Stepper Motor Calibrationsof the&nbsp;Acoustic Pressure Tank Facility (APTF) and&nbsp;Open Tank Facility (OTF). Please see the attached Request for Quotes and associated document package for additional details.
